※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 5005 LANG_STMT_VALUE_DISCARDED

※ Computing something and discarding it is the same rule; that work was done
※ for the answer makes no difference to the answer going nowhere.
let flags: u8 = 0b1010u8
let mask: u8 = 0b0010u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    flags & mask
    0u8
